To convert PDF to DOCX while preserving styling and formatting in Java, you can use the Apache PDFBox library in conjunction with the Apache POI library. PDFBox helps you extract text and images from the PDF, while POI is used to create and manipulate Word documents.

First, download the following libraries and add them to your project:

1. Apache PDFBox: https://pdfbox.apache.org/download.cgi
2. Apache POI: https://poi.apache.org/download.html
3. PDFBox-App (contains necessary dependencies): https://pdfbox.apache.org/download.cgi#20x

Here's a sample code to convert a PDF to a DOCX file:

```java
import org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.PDDocument;
import org.apache.pdfbox.text.PDFTextStripper;
import org.apache.poi.xwpf.usermodel.*;

import java.io.File;
import java.io.FileOutputStream;
import java.io.IOException;

public class PdfToDocxConverter {

    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {
        File pdfFile = new File("input.pdf");
        File docxFile = new File("output.docx");

        PDDocument pdDocument = PDDocument.load(pdfFile);
        int totalPages = pdDocument.getNumberOfPages();
        PDFTextStripper pdfTextStripper = new PDFTextStripper();

        XWPFDocument xwpfDocument = new XWPFDocument();

        for (int i = 0; i < totalPages; i++) {
            pdfTextStripper.setStartPage(i + 1);
            pdfTextStripper.setEndPage(i + 1);
            String text = pdfTextStripper.getText(pdDocument);

            XWPFParagraph paragraph = xwpfDocument.createParagraph();
            XWPFRun run = paragraph.createRun();
            run.setText(text);
            run.addBreak(BreakType.PAGE);
        }

        try (FileOutputStream fileOutputStream = new FileOutputStream(docxFile)) {
            xwpfDocument.write(fileOutputStream);
        }

        System.out.println("PDF to DOCX conversion completed.");
    }
}
```

This code will convert a PDF to DOCX file while trying to preserve the basic styling and formatting, but it's important to note that complex styles or special formatting might not be replicated perfectly. Apache PDFBox and POI don't support all features of PDF and Word documents, so there will be some limitations in converting files.

